error[8-0107]: an access through a state pointer needs the function's own authority
   ┌─ state_pointer_authority.fe:10:14
   │
10 │     unsafe { *p }
   │              ^^ this reads state the function's `uses` does not cover
   │
   = require it via `uses (storage: RawStorage)`; `unsafe` does not grant authority

