error[8-0107]: an access through a state pointer in a closure needs the closure's own authority
   ┌─ state_pointer_authority.fe:65:23
   │
65 │     apply(|| unsafe { *(0 as u256 as StorPtr<u256>) = 9 })
   │                       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this writes state the closure's row does not cover
   │
   = a closure takes none of the enclosing function's authority; use `storage_at`, or a function with `uses (storage: mut RawStorage)`, whose requirement the closure's row takes

